OL,3,GNEWSA'We're a forgotten village', say
OL,4,Alocals in Ansty
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living in the village of Ansty
OL,7,Fin Warwickshire say they feel
OL,8,F"forgotten about", six years on from a
OL,9,Flandslip that caused a partial road
OL,10,Fclosure.
OL,12,FResidents have been volunteering to
OL,13,Fmaintain the village, and say the
OL,14,Fpartially closed bridge has also been
OL,15,F"a headache".
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
