OL,3,GNEWSA'We're a forgotten village', say
OL,4,Alocals in Ansty
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarwickshire County Council said the
OL,7,Flandslip was not the authority's
OL,8,Fresponsibility and that groundwork
OL,9,Finvestigations would be taking place.
OL,10,FThe Canal & River Trust also said it
OL,11,Fwas not responsible for the landslip.
OL,12,FThe BBC have approached Rugby Borough
OL,13,FCouncil for comment.
OL,15,F"I've lived here all of my life. I've
OL,16,Fnever seen the village in such
OL,17,Fdisrepair and just totally let down and
OL,18,Fforgotten," said resident, Ian
OL,19,FRobinson.
